    "4️⃣ 'WHEN' — QACHON?\n\n📌 When is your birthday? (Tug'ilgan kuningiz qachon?)\n  In March. (Martda)\n\n📌 When do you work? (Qachon ishlaysiz?)\n  On Monday. (Dushanba kuni)\n\n📌 When do you wake up? (Qachon uyg'onasiz?)\n  At 7 AM. (7 da)\n\n📌 'When' + vaqt/joy/kun:\n  When + predlog + vaqt\n  When is your class? At 8 AM.",
    "5️⃣ 'WHY' — NEGA? / 'HOW' — QANDAY?\n\n📌 WHY (nega):\n  Why are you sad? — Nega xafasan?\n  Because I am tired. — Chunki charchadim.\n\n📌 HOW (qanday):\n  How are you? — Qandaysiz? I am fine.\n  How do you go to work? — Qanday ishlaysiz? By bus.\n\n📌 HOW OLD (necha yosh):\n  How old are you? — Necha yoshdasiz?\n  I am 20. — 20 yoshdaman.\n\n📌 HOW MANY (nechta):\n  How many books do you have? — Nechta kitobingiz bor?\n  I have three. — Uchta.\n\n📌 HOW MUCH (qancha, sanalmas):\n  How much water do you want? — Qancha suv xohlaysiz?\n  A glass, please. — Bir stakan, iltimos.",
