    "2️⃣ ENG KO'P UCHRAYDIGAN XATOLAR\n\n📌 1. AM/IS/ARE:\n  ❌ I is a student (I am a student)\n  ❌ She are kind (She is kind)\n  ❌ They is here (They are here)\n\n📌 2. HAVE/HAS:\n  ❌ He have a car (He has a car)\n  ❌ She have got a cat (She has got a cat)\n\n📌 3. 3-SHAXS -S:\n  ❌ He work here (He works here)\n  ❌ She go to school (She goes to school)\n  ❌ He study English (He studies English)\n\n📌 4. DON'T/DOESN'T + V1:\n  ❌ He doesn't works (He doesn't work)\n  ❌ I don't works (I don't work)\n\n📌 5. CAN + V1:\n  ❌ I can to swim (I can swim)\n  ❌ He cans play (He can play)\n\n📌 6. ARTIKL:\n  ❌ The car is a red (The car is red)",
    "3️⃣ GRAMMATIK JADVAL\n\n📌 TO BE:\n  I → am\n  He/She/It → is\n  You/We/They → are\n\n📌 HAVE GOT:\n  I/You/We/They → have got\n  He/She/It → has got\n\n📌 CAN:\n  Hammasi → can (o'zgarmas)\n\n📌 PRESENT SIMPLE:\n  I/You/We/They → V1 (work, play)\n  He/She/It → V1+s/-es/-ies (works, plays, studies)\n\n📌 INKOR:\n  I/You/We/They → don't + V1\n  He/She/It → doesn't + V1",
    "4️⃣ ASOSIY SAVOL SHAKLLARI\n\n📌 AM/IS/ARE bilan:\n  Are you a student? — Yes, I am.\n  Is she a teacher? — Yes, she is.\n\n📌 DO/DOES bilan:\n  Do you like tea? — Yes, I do.\n  Does he work? — Yes, he does.\n\n📌 HAVE/HAS GOT bilan:\n  Have you got a car? — Yes, I have.\n  Has she got a cat? — Yes, she has.\n\n📌 CAN bilan:\n  Can you swim? — Yes, I can.\n  Can he play? — Yes, he can.\n\n📌 WH- savollar:\n  What is your name?\n  Where do you live?\n  Who is that?\n  When is your birthday?\n  Why are you happy?\n  How are you?",
    "5️⃣ MUVAFFAQIYAT UCHUN MASLAHATLAR\n\n📌 1. Har kuni mashq qiling\n  15-30 daqiqa ingliz tilida o'qish, yozish, tinglash\n\n📌 2. Yangi so'zlarni kundalik daftarga yozing\n  Har kuni 5-10 ta yangi so'z\n\n📌 3. Speaking mashq qiling\n  O'zingizga yoki boshqalarga inglizcha gapiring\n\n📌 4. Listening mashq qiling\n  Inglizcha qo'shiq, film, podcast tinglang\n\n📌 5. Xato qilishdan qo'rqmang\n  Xato — bu o'rganishning bir qismi!\n\n📌 6. Darajangizni test qiling\n  A1 darajasini tugatgach, A2 ga o'ting",
    "6️⃣ KEYINGI QADAM — A2\n\nA1 dan keyin A2 darajasiga o'tasiz:\n\n📌 A1 da o'tilgan (takrorlash uchun):\n  • Past simple (o'tgan oddiy zamon)\n  • Present continuous (hozir davom etayotgan)\n  • Future (will, going to)\n\n📌 A2 da yangi mavzular:\n  • Modal verbs (must, should, could)\n  • Comparatives (qiyosiy: bigger, more interesting)\n  • Articles (a, an, the)\n  • Prepositions (at, in, on, by, with)\n  • 200+ yangi so'z\n\n📌 Yangi ko'nikmalar:\n  • O'tgan voqealarni gapirish (A1 da boshlangan)\n  • Rejalar haqida gapirish\n  • Taqqoslash va ta'rif\n  • Kundalik muloqot\n  • IELTS asoslari",
