      title: "A1 grammatika xulosasi",
      rule: "📌 1. AM/IS/ARE:\n  I am, He/She/It is, You/We/They are\n\n📌 2. HAVE/HAS GOT:\n  I/You/We/They have got\n  He/She/It has got\n\n📌 3. CAN (o'zgarmas):\n  I can, you can, he can, she can...\n  I can swim (V1)\n\n📌 4. PRESENT SIMPLE:\n  I/You/We/They + V1 (I work)\n  He/She/It + V1+s (He works)\n  Inkori: don't/doesn't + V1\n  Savol: Do/Does + S + V1\n\n📌 5. THERE IS/ARE:\n  Birlik/sanalmas: There is\n  Ko'plik: There are",
      mnemonic: "A1 = oddiy zamon + to be + have/has + can + there is/are. Kelajak: A2 da o'rganamiz.",
      commonMistakes: "❌ I is (I am)\n❌ He have (He has)\n❌ He can to swim (He can swim)\n❌ He work (He works)\n❌ There are a book (There is a book)",
